    "hang-bells-foreseen (tag.foreseen): awaits foreseen in combat_engine.json REQUEST_TAGS; Hang the Bells active cast runs in full",
    "carriage-bell-dodge and Rings as It Moves dodge (was_evaded): typical enemy has 0 evade; the pressing trigger runs in full"
